abstract: "ADMST is a complete, reproducible computational framework for cosmological analysis of Asymmetric Dark Matter Soliton Theory (ADMST). It provides integrated modifications to CLASS for soliton-gas physics, Cobaya interface for MCMC parameter constraints with Planck 2018 likelihoods, and Docker containerization for reproducible results across platforms."
